        'Thinking is billed as output and counts against max_tokens whether or not the text is returned; a display of omitted only hides it. At high effort the reasoning can use up a small ceiling before the visible answer starts. Raise max_tokens (the docs suggest large values at high effort levels), and manage spend through effort and by asking for a concise answer. Display settings change what you see, not what is counted; effort is a soft signal, not a separate allowance; streaming does not change the ceiling.',
